        <mxCell id="mXzSeeQdjpQh85qKFLZc-46" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Original:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Não muda nada! A própria Gleisi Hoffman, não passa de uma grande, mas muito grande fake. Falar mal de Senna , não, mas elogiar Maduro e a ditadura na Venezuela, sim, isso é fato!&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Extração de Afirmações:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;A própria Gleisi Hoffman, não passa de uma grande, mas muito grande fake.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Normalização de Afirmações:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Afirma que Gleisi Hoffman é uma grande fake e que ela elogia Maduro e a ditadura na Venezuela.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="mXzSeeQdjpQh85qKFLZc-47">
